      "mergedPostDetails": "The sorting method for uploaded avatars retains the sorting method of the last avatar list you viewed. \n\nRepro steps:\n\n- Sort uploaded avatars by any method\n\n- View one of your avatar lists that is using a different sorting method then your uploaded avatars\n\n- View uploaded avatars again and observe that the sorting method for your uploaded avatars has changed to the one used by the last viewed avatar list\n\nhttps://youtu.be/Hdcmu8ZKapc",
