      "mergeID": "68499a9e87b56cca421ea5e6",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Changing the Sorted By option in the Avatars Tab doesn't seem to save properly between certain pages of avatars. Changing 'Recently Used' page to sort by Recently Used sets on any other Saved Avatars page to also sort by Recently Used instead of Added Date. Flipping between any of these pages will make the Sorted By option change inconsistently. \n\nI believe this option should be set per page and saved. \n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Open Full Menu and go to My Avatars tab\n\n2. Go to any saved avatars page\n\n3. Change Sorted By to anything\n\n4. Move to another saved avatars page, leaves inconsistent sorting method",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1650] Changing 'Sort By' in Avatars tab doesn't save properly per page",
